{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:25f0bf06abc5758d","name":"Solar Wind","source":{"id":"source:reference-25f0bf06abc5758d","title":"Solar Wind","revision":21444,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:48:42Z","sha256":"0f627ed1b68ddfe353082d5e5caa1cdd5a56a42727310907e2a416ad35c6714c","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21444","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Solar%20Wind&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-25f0bf06abc5758d","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unknown Regions Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unknown_Regions_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["A large emission of charged particles from a nearby star, probably the result of a solar flare, poses a risk of radiation."]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A star releases its Solar Wind as a mostly steady flow of ions that can cause damage to a Starship's systems, much like an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ion Cannon"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ion_Cannon","referenceId":"reference:815dc6c626750487"},". Anyone who detects the eruption of a solar flare during combat can use the incident, if they act quickly enough, to lure opponents into the Solar Wind and hope that the ion burst is enough to knock out the enemy ship's systems for a while. In addition, a Solar Wind can give away the presence of a cloaked vessel when the ions cascade against the cloaking field and reveal the ship.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Solar Wind Statistics (CL 7)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Keywords:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Atmosphere"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Atmosphere"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Energy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Energy"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Natural"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Natural"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Trigger:"]}," A ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship"}," begins its turn exposed to Solar Wind.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Attack:"]}," +9 vs ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 3d8x2 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Ion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ion"},"; Half Damage on Miss)\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Recurrence:"]}," Each round at the start of the Starship's turn, as long as the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship"}," remains exposed to the Solar Wind.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Suggested ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skills","referenceId":"reference:66d0f523a379b2de"},":"]}," The following are suggested ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skills","referenceId":"reference:66d0f523a379b2de"}," for this Hazard:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," (DC 17):"]}," The character detects the solar flare and predicts the imminent Solar Wind."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," (DC 22):"]}," The character configures the Starship's shields to better protect it from the Hazard, granting a +5 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," bonus to the Starship's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"}," against the Solar Wind."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Special:"]}," Each creature inside the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship"}," takes half damage from ",{"tag":"a","children":["Radiation"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Radiation","referenceId":"reference:669c428e617d7f09"}," if the Hazard's attack is successful and takes no damage on a miss.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
